  "title": "The Page Reads in a Different Order",
  "family": "learning",
  "category": "accessibility/inclusion",
  "premise": "A reader wants a screen-reader-friendly explanation, but visually arranged cards have a confusing underlying sequence. A linear reading trace reveals the mismatch and a revised structure aligns the intended meaning.",
